  "worked_solution": "We know that $\\text{dim(Null}(W))$ is the number of non-pivot columns in $W.$ \n\nSince $W$ has $10$ columns and $8$ of them are pivots, then the number of non-pivot columns in $W$ is \n\n$$\n10-8=2.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\text{dim(Null}(W))=2.$",
